<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Two line charts comparing training and validation accuracy progression over thirty-two federated rounds for three models: ResNet-50, MobileNetV2 plus MobileViT, and EfficientNet-B0 plus MobileViT. Left panel shows local client training accuracy improving from about 55 to over 90 percent. Right panel shows global server validation accuracy rising from about 50 to above 90 percent, with all models reaching the target threshold by round thirty.) /K 372 0 R /P 52 0 R /Pg 10 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
308 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Line chart comparing accuracy percentages across training rounds for three models: ResNet-50 \(blue\), MobileNetV2 \(red\), and EfficientNetB0 \(green\), showing increasing accuracy with most models converging near 99 percent by round fifteen.) /K 373 0 R /P 52 0 R /Pg 10 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
309 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Four confusion matrices compare model performance. Panel \(A\) and \(B\) are multiclass confusion matrices for classifying seven crop conditions, each showing class-specific prediction counts on a blue gradient. Panel \(C\) and \(D\) are binary confusion matrices, each with \215Actual Healthy\216 and \215Actual Diseased\216 versus corresponding predictions, showing 126 true negative and 10735 true positive predictions and no errors.) /K 374 0 R /P 52 0 R /Pg 11 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
310 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Panel A shows a multi-class receiver operating characteristic \(ROC\) curve with six class-specific curves and an overall area under the curve \(AUC\) value for each, demonstrating model performance well above the random classifier. Panel B similarly displays multi-class ROC results with class-specific and aggregate AUCs, also outperforming the random classifier. Panel C presents a binary ROC curve with the ROC curve \(AUC equals 1.00\) plotted above the diagonal random classifier, indicating perfect performance. Panel D shows another binary ROC curve, again with an AUC of 1.00, signifying flawless classification.) /K 375 0 R /P 52 0 R /Pg 12 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
